cation" id="az900"><div aria-hidden="true" class="mile-dot"></div><div class="mile-box"><div class="mile-head"><span class="mile-when">Late 2026 / early 2027</span><span class="pill planned">Planned</span><span class="subline">Certification / exam goal</span></div><h2>AZ-900</h2><p>Azure Fundamentals</p><p class="note">Tentative learning and exam goal; not booked.</p></div></article><article class="mile" data-track="certification" id="sc300"><div aria-hidden="true" class="mile-dot"></div><div class="mile-box"><div class="mile-head"><span class="mile-when">Jan 2027</span><span class="pill planned">Planned</span><span class="subline">Certification / exam goal</span></div><h2>SC-300 Academy</h2><p>Identity and Access Administrator</p><p class="note">Planned start; all 11 lab activities remain Planned, with no confirmed exam date.</p></div></article><article class="mile" data-track="learning" id="selective"><div aria-hidden="true" class="mile-dot"></div><div class="mile-box"><div class="mile-head"><span class="mile-when">2027 — phased</span><span class="pill planned">Planned</span><span class="subline">Learning path / skills</span></div><h2>Azure &amp; detection skills</h2><p>AZ-104 securitymodules, KQL en Defender (SC-200 leerstof)</p><p class="note">Selected practical skills; AZ-104 and SC-200 are not mandatory exam targets.</p></div></article><article class="mile" data-track="certification" id="sc500"><div aria-hidden="true" class="mile-dot"></div><div class="mile-box"><div class="mile-head"><span class="mile-when">Late 2027 or later</span><span class="pill conditional">Voorwaardelijk</span><span class="subline">Certification / exam goal</span></div><h2>SC-500</h2><p>Cloud &amp; AI Security Engineer — conditional option</p><p class="note">Only after a future review of role relevance and independently verified Azure experience.</p></div></article></div><div class="policy"><h2>How do I measure progress?</h2><p>My Academy records objectives, exercises actually performed